<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 53,639.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 53,639.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 11 totaled 53,639 bales, up from 52,752 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 892 bales issued, no decertification orders, five cancellations, and 3,100 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
